                    briefing_title_r1:      `Round 1 — Diagnose the fairness failure`,
                    briefing_text_r1:       `You have the two candidate files, the grievance, the fairness-score trend and the engagement verbatims. Perceived fairness is <strong>58/100</strong>, down from 71. Before touching the promotion, work out <em>which kind</em> of fairness Nordlys has been failing — <strong>distributive</strong> (the outcomes), <strong>procedural</strong> (the process), or <strong>interactional</strong> (the respect and explanation). The clue is in the data: the score fell not because of <em>who</em> won past promotions, but because <em>how</em> was opaque. Acknowledge the open grievance and listen before you design anything.`,
